The two most serious findings:
- **Wrong summaries in the UI:** a turn can show the title or abstract of one of its own steps.
- **Secret leak:** a custom redaction rule without the `g` flag hides only the first match, so later secrets can end up in the committed `.yolo-twice` folder.

